/**
 * A configuration source that translates OpenTelemetry system properties and environment variables
 * into their Datadog equivalents.
 *
 * <p>The translation only happens when the OpenTelemetry compatibility mode is explicitly enabled
 * through the {@code dd.trace.otel.enabled} system property or the {@code DD_TRACE_OTEL_ENABLED}
 * environment variable. When it is not enabled, this source returns {@code null} for every key so
 * that no OpenTelemetry setting can leak into the Datadog configuration.
 */
